<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>LoL Human REST API</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
        body { background: #191c20; color: #fff; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 100vh; text-align: center; padding: 20px; }
        .box { background: #1d2025; border: 1px solid #2b3038; padding: 48px 36px; border-radius: 14px; max-width: 540px; }
        h1 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        h1 span { color: #f06a6a; }
        p { color: #94a3b8; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 28px; line-height: 1.7; }
        .btns { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; }
        .btn { padding: 11px 24px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; }
        .btn-primary { background: #f06a6a; color: #fff; }
        .btn-secondary { background: #252930; color: #cbd5e1; border: 1px solid #2b3038; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="box">
        <h1>lolhuman<span>api.</span></h1>
        <p>Penyedia layanan REST API cepat, stabil, dan siap pakai untuk kebutuhan Bot WhatsApp, Telegram, dan Web Development.</p>
        <div class="btns">
            <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-primary">Buka Dashboard</a>
            <a href="/users/login" class="btn btn-secondary">Login / Register</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
